  "rational": [
    "I located the 'Conclusion and future prospective' section which explicitly discusses clinical research on metal ion supplementation for CVDs, including two clinical trials (Woods et al. on magnesium sulfate in acute MI, and Roth et al. on magnesium for restenosis).",
    "I also located the 'Protecting cells from oxidative stress' section which mentions a clinical trial on zinc supplementation in elderly subjects (Prasad et al.) showing reduced lipid peroxidation.",
    "The 'Introduction' and 'Positive effects' sections provide mechanistic background (antioxidant, angiogenic, ion channel modulation) but no additional chelation trial results. The article does not cover chelation therapy for CVDs."
